e": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [400, 562], "pos": [799.0843505859375, 1407.12255859375], "id": 325, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [53], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [797.8340454101562, 1105.708740234375], "widgets_values": ["# T2VA 提示词撰写指南（仅 T2VA 格式）\n\n## 任务总览\n\n用户上传**参考图**和**自己写的原始版提示词**后，输出一份符合 T2VA 格式的完整提示词给用户。\n\n### 使用流程（必读）\n\n- 当用户直接上传本文档、但尚未同时附带参考图和原始版提示词时，**不要输出任何其他内容**，先引导用户上传参考图片和原始版提示词。\n- 待用户补齐「参考图 + 原始提示词」后，再按本文档规范输出 T2VA 格式提示词。\n\n> 参考图用途说明：T2VA 本身不做画面对齐，参考图仅用于提取视觉风格、主体外观、场景与构图等细节；最终输出**不含**画面对齐指令，也**不使用** `<Picture 1>` 之类的标签，直接以文本构建完整视听时间线。\n\n## 最终提示词结构\n\nT2VA 没有画面对齐指令，直接从三个核心字段开始：\n\n```text\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] ...\n\noverall_soundscape: ...\n\nnon_diegetic_music: ...\n```\n\n- **integrated_multimodal_description**：沿时间线描述画面、动作、镜头、说话人、对白、歌唱以及画面内音频。\n- **overall_soundscape**：总结整段视频的环境声、动作音效与非语言人声。\n- **non_diegetic_music**：描述角色听不到、只有观众能听到的背景音乐。\n\n## 三个核心字段的撰写规范\n\n### 1. 沿时间线展开 integrated_multimodal_description\n\n`integrated_multimodal_description` 是改写后提示词的主体。每一个细节都应对应到可见或可听的内容：视觉风格、初始构图、主体外观与位置、场景与关键道具、动作与反应、镜头切换、口头语言、以及同步的画面内音效。\n\n在 `[Shot 1]` 开头说明整体风格与初始构图。常见风格包括 `Cinematic`、`live-action`、`2D-animated`、`3D CG`、`claymation`、`watercolor`、`vintage film` 等。T2VA 模式从用户文本中选取风格。\n\n```text\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium-wide shot frames...\n```\n\n### 2. 镜头与切换\n\n第一个镜头不要加时间戳；后续镜头使用递增的镜头编号，每个镜头以严格递增、且落在视频时长内的切换时间开头：\n\n```text\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.500, the camera cuts to...\n```\n\n普通切换使用 `the camera cuts to`、`the shot cuts to`、`the shot transitions to`、`the shot changes to` 或 `the shot switches to`。用户明确要求时，也可使用 cross-dissolve、fade 或 wipe。切换应引入关于主体、空间、状态、视角或时间的新信息；若只需改变距离或轻微角度，优先使用运镜而非切换。\n\n### 3. 运镜：运动类型 + 幅度 + 速度\n\n完整的运镜表达包含三个维度：**运动类型**定义相机如何运动，**幅度**定义构图变化的范围，**速度**定义变化的节奏。幅度与速度仅在有意义时才添加；中等幅度与正常速度通常省略。\n\n| 维度 | 可用表达 | 说明 |\n|-|-|-|\n| 运动类型 | `Zoom In / Zoom Out` | 机身不动、焦距改变 |\n| 运动类型 | `Push In / Pull Out` | 相机向前 / 向后移动 |\n| 运动类型 | `Pan Left / Pan Right` | 机身不动、镜头水平转动 |\n| 运动类型 | `Truck Left / Truck Right` | 相机水平平移 |\n| 运动类型 | `Tilt Up / Tilt Down` | 机身不动、镜头垂直转动 |\n| 运动类型 | `Pedestal Up / Pedestal Down` | 整机向上 / 向下移动 |\n| 运动类型 | `Arc Shot` | 相机围绕主体做弧形运动 |\n| 运动类型 | `Tracking Shot` | 相机跟随移动主体 |\n| 运动类型 | `Static Shot` | 机位与镜头保持静止 |\n| 运动类型 | `Shake Slightly / Shake Strongly` | 轻微 / 强烈晃动 |\n| 运动类型 | `POV` | 主体视角 |\n| 运动类型 | `Roll Clockwise / Roll Counterclockwise` | 绕镜头轴顺时针 / 逆时针旋转 |\n| 幅度 | `with small amplitude` | 小范围变化 |\n| 幅度 | `with large amplitude` | 大范围变化 |\n| 速度 | `at slow speed` | 缓慢 |\n| 速度 | `at fast speed` | 快速 |\n\n运镜应写成镜头内的自然英文动作，而不是堆在句子末尾当作独立标签：\n\n```text\nThe camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward the folded letter in her hands.\nThe camera pans right with large amplitude at fast speed, revealing the open doorway.\nThe camera holds a static shot as the runner exits the frame.\n```\n\n### 4. 说话人、对白与歌唱\n\n说话、歌唱或发出画外人声的主体使用稳定 ID，如 `(S1)`、`(S2)`。多个已有编号的说话人同时发声时使用组合 ID，如 `(S1,S2)`。同一说话人跨镜头保持同一 ID；从不发声的角色不分配说话人 ID。\n\n说话人首次出现时，从画面与音频语境中提供足以建立稳定身份的信息，如角色类型、年龄、性别、是否在画内、音高、音色、语速或口音。说话人的身份短语、ID、动作与表达方式放在 `<d>` 之外；`<d>` 内只放语言标签和用户实际提供的台词内容。逐字保留原始措辞与标点，不翻译、不改写。\n\n```text\nThe young woman with a quiet, breathy voice (S1) says: <d>[English] I get off at the next station.</d>\nThe two children (S1,S2) shout together, <d>[English] Wait for us!</d>\n```\n\n画外音使用固定短语 `says in an off-screen voiceover`。每个画外音 `<d>` 块之后，立即说明对应画内角色双唇保持闭合：\n\n```text\nThe man (S1) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[English] I still remember that road.</d> while his lips remain completely closed.\n```\n\n当同一句对白或歌词跨越切换时，在两部分连接处使用 `<scenetrans>`，并明确说明音频跨越切换继续。当台词被视频结尾截断时使用 `<cutoff>`。连续性可用 `continues seamlessly across the cut`、`continues uninterrupted into the next shot`、`carries over from the previous shot` 或 `remains audible across the transition` 表达。\n\n### 5. 屏幕文字\n\n屏幕上真实可见的横幅、招牌、标签、字幕或霓虹文字，用英文双引号括起，逐字保留原文与标点、不翻译：\n\n```text\nA red neon sign reading \"营业中\" glows above the doorway.\n```\n\n### 6. overall_soundscape\n\n用 1–4 句英文、一个连续段落总结整段视频的环境声、动作音效与非语言人声，如风声、雨声、车流、脚步、衣物摩擦、撞击、呼吸、笑声或喘息。对白、歌唱与画面内音乐已属于 integrated_multimodal_description，不应在此重复。仅当用户明确要求全程静音时才用 `N/A`。\n\n```text\noverall_soundscape: Steady rain taps against the café windows while low room ambience continues underneath. The entrance bell rings once, followed by wet footsteps and the soft scrape of a chair.\n```\n\n### 7. non_diegetic_music\n\n用 1–3 句英文描述角色听不到、只有观众能听到的背景音乐，聚焦乐器、速度、节奏与力度变化；不用抽象情绪词，也不解释配乐的情感功能。角色能听到的歌唱、乐器、收音机、电视或手机音乐属于画面内事件，应写进 integrated_multimodal_description。没有非叙事音乐时用 `N/A`。\n\n```text\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse piano notes at a slow tempo, joined by sustained low strings that gradually increase in volume before fading out.\n```\n\n## 示例：T2VA\n\n无参考图时，直接从文本构建完整时间线。可以补充与用户意图一致的场景、角色、动作与声音细节。\n\n```text\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium-wide shot frames a baker opening the shutters of a small street bakery before sunrise. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as the middle-aged baker with a calm, slightly raspy voice (S1) places a fresh loaf on the wooden counter and says: <d>[English] First batch of the morning.</d> [Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts to a close-up of steam rising from the sliced bread while the baker's final words carry over from the previous shot.\n\noverall_soundscape: Wooden shutters scrape open over a quiet street as trays clink softly inside the bakery. The doorbell rings once, followed by light footsteps and the crisp sound of bread being sliced.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A soft acoustic-guitar pattern at a moderate tempo, joined by sparse upright-bass notes and a gentle fade at the end.\n```\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 326, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [52], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [76.38957214355469, 131.68646240234375], "widgets_values": ["生成一条英国区tiktok爆款达人带货视频，英文口播，要求具备原生感，环境，背景以及使用场景，要求严格根据服饰适合的场景。环境完全现实可实现，不是摄影棚，完全贴合生活使用，裤子严格参考用户提供的图片，完全匹配款式，颜色，纹路，造型的整体细节。达人穿着图片所给的服饰，出现在合适的场景完全，口播介绍写字的外形，颜色，特点，使用环境，以及穿着舒适度。真实实拍照片，iphone原相机拍摄随手拍摄质感，4K高清，细腻画质，柔和网红滤镜，休闲穿搭氛围感视频转场快速切换不要有拖影，全程无 BGM、无广告感，人物形象固定统一，整体贴合英国 TikTok 爆款自然原生氛围，全画幅比例为9：16，不添加视频字幕。男士裤子"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 266, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [45], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [100, 716], "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors", "minimax", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "id": 270, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "ds": {"offs